# ABOUTME: Cache-Control rules for Workers static assets, copied to .open-next/assets at build.
# ABOUTME: Content-hashed /_next/static/* filenames are immutable, so they never need revalidating.
#
# Without this, the ASSETS binding serves them with the Workers Assets default of
# `public, max-age=0, must-revalidate`, so every repeat visit spends ~14 conditional
# round trips to receive 14 304s. Measured under `wrangler dev` — confirm against a
# real deploy with the `curl -I` step in docs/deploy.md §Post-deploy verification.
/_next/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
